<!-- GREENTIDE_FREE_ROSTER_OWNED_1. The Flier: a screaming canopy flock. Real 1.6 flight, the Locust shape
     (MaxFlightTime stat is the switch; verify by stat read, never by sight). No flight frames: flying without
     them is correct, plainer. Its calls are the ambient layer the silence cue hushes. -->
<Defs>
