    <defName>RM_Yammeth</defName>
    <label>yammeth</label>
    <description>A light, wiry canopy flier with two pairs of broad membranes in hot magenta and acid yellow and a throat sac it puffs out to scream. Flocks shriek across the Greentide all day, so loud the noise is the background of the place. When something large is hunting nearby the flock goes quiet at once, and that silence is the warning.</description>
